<title>PORTUGAL: Portuguese construction indicator weaker Feb - INE.</title>
<headline>Portuguese construction indicator weaker Feb - INE.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>An indicator measuring confidence in Portuguese construction and public works based on a survey of local businesses was slightly weaker in February than January, the National Statistics Institute said.</p>
<p>It said in a monthly report that the main reason for the trend was negative sentiment about job prospects in the sector.</p>
</text>
